    Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock
    Full license text: LICENSE-upstream

Pinned source: see `UPSTREAM.json` (version, 40-character commit, and the
`.claude-plugin/plugin.json#skills` list that defines the shipped set).

The vendored files are the upstream `SKILL.md` trees with these mechanical
changes only, applied by `scripts/sync-upstream.mjs`:

  - body rewrite: `Skill tool` -> `` `skill` tool `` (21 occurrences in 10 files);
  - frontmatter normalization: `description` re-quoted as a JSON string, the
    Codex-only `argument-hint` (2 skills) and `metadata` (1 skill) keys dropped;
    unknown top-level keys are dropped with a warning;
  - not vendored: every per-skill `agents/openai.yaml` (Codex UI metadata) and
    upstream's bucket READMEs;
  - nothing else in the instruction bodies is edited.

`skills/` therefore differs from a raw upstream checkout by exactly those
changes — it is NOT "unmodified". The diff is reproducible with
`node scripts/sync-upstream.mjs --source <upstream-checkout>`.

The plugin code (`lib/`, `scripts/`, `test-*.mjs`, `cordis.patch.yml`,
`package.json`) is original work by 擎天 / tianji-qingtian under the MIT License
in `LICENSE`. `skills/pr/CREDITS.md` carries upstream's own attribution for the
`pr` skill (Dex Horthy / Humanlayer), and is vendored verbatim.

If you redistribute this package, keep both `LICENSE` (this plugin) and
`LICENSE-upstream` (the vendored skills) alongside this NOTICE.
